# Regenerable build output and tool scratch. Everything a backup exists for
# (.data, .product, .git, uncommitted work, .env) is deliberately NOT listed here.
#
# dist            146M, rebuilt by `npm run build`
# .astro          Astro's content cache, and a known source of phantom-entry build failures
# .wrangler       wrangler's local state cache
# .playwright-mcp browser captures. Regenerable, and it is the directory that held plaintext
#                 GitHub tokens on 2026-08-25, so it should not be copied to another machine
#                 even inside an encrypted archive.
dist
.astro
.wrangler
.playwright-mcp
